NvwHHbica&_nc_oc=AdqOOhePXIb7yqI9-scqGLPl3WfUH0nIHgB_JeDlGjCY3idQwLB-f8WxrlB69AaIsmQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDmmOrr30zyFgC-LZ95gGK8x0ZEt4S73KFdjXF196vIMg&oe=6A491EDD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Blendimals", "keywords": ["animals", "kids", "creatures", "family", "mixing"], "long_description": "Welcome to Blendimals!\n\nStep into a magical forest and use your controllers to mix cute animals with everyday objects \u2014 and discover what adorable hybrid creatures appear!\n\nHow to Play:\nPick up an animal, mix it with an object, and see which unique hybrid creature is revealed. Simple to learn, endlessly surprising!\n\nFeatures:\n- Unique hybrid creatures** to discover and unlock\n- Beautiful VR forest environment** with a stunning night sky\n- Designed for kids** \u2014 simple, intuitive, and safe\n- No ads, no in-app purchases** \u2014 just pure fun\n- Supports Meta Quest controllers**\n\nPerfect for the Whole Family\nBlendimals is designed for children but enjoyed by the whole family. Simple enough for the youngest players, surprising enough to delight everyone.\n\n## A World Full of Surprises\nEvery combination reveals a new creature. What happens when you mix a bat with a cactus? Or a dragon with a cloud? Jump in and find out!", "short_description": "Mix cute animals with everyday objects and discover adorable hybrid creatures in a magical VR forest! Easy to pick up, impossible to put down. Perfect for the whole family!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://blendimals.web.app/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "morokar", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://blendimals.web.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external